Thus we need: candidate_clearance_established, compliance_validation_complete (goal also wants candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha; but compliance_validation_complete is not in goal). However finalize_candidate_direct does not require compliance_validation_complete. So we can ignore that.

