Origin_availability_alpha: we need to lock it (to get origin_availability_locked and confirmed). Already have candidate_prepared, need operator_linked. We'll assign operator.

We also need transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized for mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready. That's same as before: after we assemble leg and authorize loading, we can mark origin and destination dispatch ready.

