Goal also wants transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, transport_leg_loading_authorized true. So we will achieve those.

Goal also wants origin_node_occupied, destination_node_occupied true (already true). Good.

Goal wants origin_availability_confirmed and origin_availability_locked true (we will achieve via lock). Destination already has them.

